OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some hill fog and the odd
OL,7,Fspot of drizzle. Skies will brighten a
OL,8,Flittle through the morning, though
OL,9,Frain will arrive from the west during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon, some turning heavy.
OL,11,FFairly warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe evening will be cloudy,
OL,14,Fwet and breezy with heavy rain in
OL,15,Fplaces. The rain will slowly ease from
OL,16,Fthe north overnight. Staying quite
OL,17,Fwarm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
