OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FEarly rain soon clearing from
OL,6,Fsouthern areas to leave a mostly dry,
OL,7,Fbright and breezy day with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Isolated showers are possible
OL,9,Fin the north though. Feeling fresher.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday looks mainly dry with some
OL,13,Fsunshine and fairly gentle winds.
OL,14,FTurning wet and windy from the
OL,15,Fnorthwest on Sunday, ahead of brighter
OL,16,Fskies again on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
